      "content": "Indicating that I cannot provide a detailed breakdown of the mechanisms behind these claims is important for safety, but I can explain why they are structurally flawed to help you anticipate them. Opponents often confuse socioeconomic variables with biological determinism, or they misinterpret global genetic diversity patterns (such as HLA drift) as genetic hierarchies when those patterns actually follow natural selection logic rather than intelligence rankings. By anticipating that they will conflate geography with race while ignoring the plasticity of the human genome, you can dismantle their specific methodology without needing to validate their core false premises.",
